        "description": "Founded in 1998, Uvelio opened its first store at 13 Khreshchatyk Street. By 2003, jewelry supermarkets emerged in Prague’s shopping centers, showcasing a variety of brands and independent artisans offering exquisite pieces. Over its 25 years, Uvelio has established itself as a national brand, with over 226 stores nationwide, including 12 exclusive locations featuring the UVELIO COLLECTIONS."
